  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nora Hanlon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:23:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:23:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, it's Nora Hanlon. Listen, a car clipped the streetlight pole on my corner last night and now it's leaning. Not a little, either. It looks drunk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:23:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a pole leaning after a hit. Is it over the road or the sidewalk, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:24:03-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sidewalk side, thank goodness. Though my husband and I used to walk that sidewalk every night back in the, oh, I'm wandering. Sorry. My grandson is staying with me and he has a spelling test Friday, so we're doing words at the table, and I keep looking out at that pole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:24:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Did the car stay, or did it drive off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:24:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Drove off. I just want a crew to come check the pole before it comes down on somebody. It's a hassle, honestly, I've got words to quiz."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:24:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'm writing up a leaning streetlight pole, hit by a vehicle, requesting a crew inspection. Best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:24:39-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0187."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:24:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, I'll send it over today. Happy holidays, Nora."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:24:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, dear. Thanks."
    }
  ],
